<p>4.4 You're responsible for holding the qualifications, insurance and vehicle documents your work requires. Vehicle and document reminders in the Service are a convenience, not a substitute for your own checks.</p>

<h2>5. Plans, fees and payment</h2>
<p>5.1 Until 31 March 2027 the Service is free, and no subscription fee is charged.</p>
<p>5.2 From 1 April 2027 you can use:</p>
<ul>
