<li><strong>Solo:</strong> £22 a month.</li>
<li><strong>School:</strong> £22 a month plus £10 a month for each extra instructor.</li>
</ul>
<p>We are not VAT-registered, so no VAT is added. If we register, we'll tell you at least 30 days before VAT is added.</p>
<p>5.3 We may change or withdraw the Free plan in future. We'll give you at least 90 days' notice by email, and you'll always be able to export your data.</p>
<p>5.4 <strong>Founding price and card authorisation.</strong> If you add a card by 1 March 2027, you pay £15 a month (School: £15 plus £8 a month for each extra instructor) for 24 months from 1 April 2027. After that you pay our standard price at the time, and we'll tell you at least 30 days before it changes. By saving your card you authorise us to charge it monthly in advance, starting on 1 April 2027, until you cancel. We won't charge it earlier, and we'll email you at least 7 days before the first charge.</p>
<p>5.5 Paid plans are billed monthly in advance. You can cancel at any time in Settings &gt; Billing, or by emailing <a href="mailto:support@driveschoolpro.com">support@driveschoolpro.com</a>. Your plan then runs to the end of the month you've paid for and is not renewed. Fees already paid are not refunded, except under clauses 2.3, 12.2 and 13, or where the law requires it.</p>
