<p>6.2 For card payments taken through DriveSchoolPro, we deduct the platform fee shown in your payment settings (currently 3% of each payment). There's no DriveSchoolPro fee on cash, bank transfer or cheque payments you record. You must not add a card surcharge to what your pupils pay.</p>
<p>6.3 Your lessons, packages and prices are a contract between you and your pupil, not with us. You're responsible for your own terms with pupils, for refunds, and for handling chargebacks and disputes. We'll help by providing the records we hold.</p>
<p>6.4 You can show your own terms to pupils when they book online (in your online booking settings), and we record when each pupil accepts them. We don't check or take responsibility for what your terms say.</p>
<p>6.5 If you refund a card payment through DriveSchoolPro, we refund our platform fee in proportion to the amount refunded.</p>

