<p>7.2 You can export Your Data at any time from Settings &gt; Profile.</p>
<p>7.3 If you close your account, we keep Your Data for 30 days so you can change your mind or export it, and then delete it, with two exceptions:</p>
<ul>
<li>records we must keep by law, such as financial records for 6 years, are kept for that period;</li>
<li>backups expire on their normal cycle, which takes up to 12 months.</li>
</ul>
<p>7.4 We back up the Service regularly. If Your Data is lost or damaged because of a fault on our side, we'll use reasonable efforts to restore it from our most recent backup. This is your only remedy for lost or damaged data, except where clause 9.1 says otherwise.</p>
<p>7.5 We may use anonymised, aggregated data (for example, average lessons per instructor) to run and improve the Service. It will never identify you or any pupil.</p>
<p>7.6 Only record health information or upload ID or medical documents where you need them, for example to make a reasonable adjustment for a pupil, and only with a lawful basis. Keep that information in the fields provided for it, not in lesson notes.</p>
<p>7.7 The <a href="#data-processing">Data Processing Terms</a> in the Schedule below apply whenever we handle personal data on your behalf.</p>

